{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 33,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 307.673,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 7.105,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now after Alma had spoken these words, they sent forth unto him desiring to know whether they should believe in one God,",
      "verse": "33:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 7.285,
      "end": 10.489,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might obtain this fruit of which he had spoken,",
      "verse": "33:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 10.669,
      "end": 15.592,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or how they should plant the seed, or the word of which he had spoken,",
      "verse": "33:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 15.772,
      "end": 18.419,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which he said must be planted in their hearts;",
      "verse": "33:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 18.599,
      "end": 22.175,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or in what manner they should begin to exercise their faith.",
      "verse": "33:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 22.855,
      "end": 24.573,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Alma said unto them:",
      "verse": "33:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 24.753,
      "end": 28.097,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, ye have said that ye could not worship your God",
      "verse": "33:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 28.277,
      "end": 30.831,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because ye are cast out of your synagogues.",
      "verse": "33:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 31.011,
      "end": 32.822,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, I say unto you,",
      "verse": "33:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 33.002,
      "end": 36.81,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if ye suppose that ye cannot worship God, ye do greatly err,",
      "verse": "33:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 36.99,
      "end": 39.126,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye ought to search the scriptures;",
      "verse": "33:2",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 39.306,
      "end": 44.507,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if ye suppose that they have taught you this, ye do not understand them.",
      "verse": "33:2",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 45.187,
      "end": 47.137,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Do ye remember to have read",
      "verse": "33:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 47.317,
      "end": 52.007,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "what Zenos, the prophet of old, has said concerning prayer or worship?",
      "verse": "33:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 52.687,
      "end": 54.034,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For he said:",
      "verse": "33:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 54.214,
      "end": 56.257,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thou art merciful, O God,",
      "verse": "33:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 56.437,
      "end": 58.62,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for thou hast heard my prayer,",
      "verse": "33:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 58.8,
      "end": 60.936,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even when I was in the wilderness;",
      "verse": "33:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 61.116,
      "end": 63.113,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, thou wast merciful",
      "verse": "33:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 63.293,
      "end": 66.683,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when I prayed concerning those who were mine enemies,",
      "verse": "33:4",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 66.863,
      "end": 68.767,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thou didst turn them to me.",
      "verse": "33:4",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 69.447,
      "end": 70.747,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, O God,",
      "verse": "33:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 70.927,
      "end": 73.11,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thou wast merciful unto me",
      "verse": "33:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 73.29,
      "end": 75.751,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when I did cry unto thee in my field;",
      "verse": "33:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 75.931,
      "end": 78.392,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when I did cry unto thee in my prayer,",
      "verse": "33:5",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 78.572,
      "end": 80.105,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thou didst hear me.",
      "verse": "33:5",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 80.785,
      "end": 83.664,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again, O God, when I did turn to my house",
      "verse": "33:6",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 83.844,
      "end": 85.655,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thou didst hear me in my prayer.",
      "verse": "33:6",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 86.335,
      "end": 89.168,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And when I did turn unto my closet, O Lord,",
      "verse": "33:7",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 89.348,
      "end": 91.577,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and prayed unto thee, thou didst hear me.",
      "verse": "33:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 92.257,
      "end": 94.765,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, thou art merciful unto thy children",
      "verse": "33:8",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 94.945,
      "end": 96.524,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when they cry unto thee,",
      "verse": "33:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 96.704,
      "end": 99.165,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to be heard of thee and not of men",
      "verse": "33:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 99.345,
      "end": 100.831,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thou wilt hear them.",
      "verse": "33:8",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 101.511,
      "end": 102.811,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, O God,",
      "verse": "33:9",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 102.991,
      "end": 105.22,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thou hast been merciful unto me,",
      "verse": "33:9",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 105.4,
      "end": 108.465,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and heard my cries in the midst of thy congregations.",
      "verse": "33:9",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 109.145,
      "end": 111.142,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and thou hast also heard me",
      "verse": "33:10",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 111.322,
      "end": 115.084,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when I have been cast out and have been despised by mine enemies;",
      "verse": "33:10",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 115.264,
      "end": 117.261,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, thou didst hear my cries,",
      "verse": "33:10",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 117.441,
      "end": 119.856,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and wast angry with mine enemies,",
      "verse": "33:10",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 120.036,
      "end": 124.216,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thou didst visit them in thine anger with speedy destruction.",
      "verse": "33:10",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 124.896,
      "end": 129.865,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thou didst hear me because of mine afflictions and my sincerity;",
      "verse": "33:11",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 130.045,
      "end": 134.039,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it is because of thy Son that thou hast been thus merciful unto me,",
      "verse": "33:11",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 134.219,
      "end": 137.377,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore I will cry unto thee in all mine afflictions,",
      "verse": "33:11",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 137.557,
      "end": 139.368,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for in thee is my joy;",
      "verse": "33:11",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 139.548,
      "end": 144.238,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for thou hast turned thy judgments away from me, because of thy Son.",
      "verse": "33:11",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 144.918,
      "end": 146.961,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now Alma said unto them:",
      "verse": "33:12",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 147.141,
      "end": 151.46,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Do ye believe those scriptures which have been written by them of old?",
      "verse": "33:12",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 152.14,
      "end": 155.344,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, if ye do, ye must believe what Zenos said;",
      "verse": "33:13",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 155.524,
      "end": 157.149,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for, behold he said:",
      "verse": "33:13",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 157.329,
      "end": 160.626,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thou hast turned away thy judgments because of thy Son.",
      "verse": "33:13",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 161.306,
      "end": 162.885,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now behold, my brethren,",
      "verse": "33:14",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 163.065,
      "end": 165.433,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I would ask if ye have read the scriptures?",
      "verse": "33:14",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 165.613,
      "end": 168.724,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "If ye have, how can ye disbelieve on the Son of God?",
      "verse": "33:14",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 169.404,
      "end": 173.166,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For it is not written that Zenos alone spake of these things,",
      "verse": "33:15",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 173.346,
      "end": 175.807,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but Zenock also spake of these things\u2014",
      "verse": "33:15",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 176.487,
      "end": 178.112,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, he said:",
      "verse": "33:16",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 178.292,
      "end": 180.846,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thou art angry, O Lord, with this people,",
      "verse": "33:16",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 181.026,
      "end": 183.58,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because they will not understand thy mercies",
      "verse": "33:16",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 183.76,
      "end": 187.104,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which thou hast bestowed upon them because of thy Son.",
      "verse": "33:16",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 187.784,
      "end": 189.084,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my brethren,",
      "verse": "33:17",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 189.264,
      "end": 193.49,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye see that a second prophet of old has testified of the Son of God,",
      "verse": "33:17",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 193.67,
      "end": 197.989,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and because the people would not understand his words they stoned him to death.",
      "verse": "33:17",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 198.669,
      "end": 200.666,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, this is not all;",
      "verse": "33:18",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 200.846,
      "end": 205.118,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "these are not the only ones who have spoken concerning the Son of God.",
      "verse": "33:18",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 205.798,
      "end": 208.074,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, he was spoken of by Moses;",
      "verse": "33:19",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 208.254,
      "end": 211.969,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and behold a type was raised up in the wilderness,",
      "verse": "33:19",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 212.149,
      "end": 214.796,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that whosoever would look upon it might live.",
      "verse": "33:19",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 214.976,
      "end": 216.741,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And many did look and live.",
      "verse": "33:19",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 217.421,
      "end": 220.161,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But few understood the meaning of those things,",
      "verse": "33:20",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 220.341,
      "end": 224.196,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this because of the hardness of their hearts.",
      "verse": "33:20",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 224.376,
      "end": 228.695,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But there were many who were so hardened that they would not look,",
      "verse": "33:20",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 228.875,
      "end": 230.408,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they perished.",
      "verse": "33:20",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 230.588,
      "end": 232.771,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the reason they would not look",
      "verse": "33:20",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 232.951,
      "end": 236.016,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "is because they did not believe that it would heal them.",
      "verse": "33:20",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 236.696,
      "end": 237.95,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O my brethren,",
      "verse": "33:21",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 238.13,
      "end": 241.659,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if ye could be healed by merely casting about your eyes",
      "verse": "33:21",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 241.839,
      "end": 243.372,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye might be healed,",
      "verse": "33:21",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 243.552,
      "end": 245.363,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "would ye not behold quickly,",
      "verse": "33:21",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 245.543,
      "end": 250.373,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or would ye rather harden your hearts in unbelief, and be slothful,",
      "verse": "33:21",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 250.553,
      "end": 253.2,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye would not cast about your eyes,",
      "verse": "33:21",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 253.38,
      "end": 254.913,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye might perish?",
      "verse": "33:21",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 255.593,
      "end": 257.869,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "If so, wo shall come upon you;",
      "verse": "33:22",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 258.049,
      "end": 260.789,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but if not so, then cast about your eyes",
      "verse": "33:22",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 260.969,
      "end": 263.616,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and begin to believe in the Son of God,",
      "verse": "33:22",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 263.796,
      "end": 266.164,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he will come to redeem his people,",
      "verse": "33:22",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 266.344,
      "end": 270.106,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that he shall suffer and die to atone for their sins;",
      "verse": "33:22",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 270.286,
      "end": 273.165,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that he shall rise again from the dead,",
      "verse": "33:22",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 273.345,
      "end": 276.224,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which shall bring to pass the resurrection,",
      "verse": "33:22",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 276.404,
      "end": 283.138,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that all men shall stand before him, to be judged at the last and judgment day, according to their works.",
      "verse": "33:22",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 283.818,
      "end": 285.118,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my brethren,",
      "verse": "33:23",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 285.298,
      "end": 288.549,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I desire that ye shall plant this word in your hearts,",
      "verse": "33:23",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 288.729,
      "end": 292.584,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and as it beginneth to swell even so nourish it by your faith.",
      "verse": "33:23",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 292.764,
      "end": 298.151,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, it will become a tree, springing up in you unto everlasting life.",
      "verse": "33:23",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 298.331,
      "end": 303.625,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And then may God grant unto you that your burdens may be light, through the joy of his Son.",
      "verse": "33:23",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 303.805,
      "end": 305.988,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And even all this can ye do if ye will.",
      "verse": "33:23",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 306.168,
      "end": 307.004,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Amen.",
      "verse": "33:23",
      "lineIndex": 100
    }
  ]
}